+        """Rewrite DSV4 ``tid2eid`` sharding into a per-layer full replica.
+
+        ``tid2eid`` is a full-vocabulary hash routing table, so every rank holds
+        the same complete tensor. The default builder derives its metadata from
+        the owning expert parameter, which yields an invalid layout. The layer
+        index only lives in the prepended axis, so fold it back into the key
+        before declaring a plain replica.
